+## 如何复验
+```
+# 最新主版 release 与资产 digest（应与 Homebrew cask 的 sha256 相同）
+gh api repos/Ji4n1ng/OpenInTerminal/releases/latest -q .tag_name                 # → v2.3.9
+gh api repos/Ji4n1ng/OpenInTerminal/releases/tags/v2.3.9 -q '.assets[] | [.name, .digest]'
+
+# 解压后只读检查（不启动、不安装）
+ditto -x -k OpenInTerminal.zip ./x
+codesign --verify --deep --strict --verbose=2 ./x/OpenInTerminal.app
+codesign -dvvv ./x/OpenInTerminal.app 2>&1 | grep -E '^(Identifier|TeamIdentifier)='
+#   → Identifier=wang.jianing.app.OpenInTerminal / TeamIdentifier=C8VX3ZLX5U
+xcrun stapler validate ./x/OpenInTerminal.app                                    # → The validate action worked!
+
+# 检测：production 的 UpdateChecker 链，对只含 Contents/Info.plist 的夹具运行
+swift run --package-path application-test channel-verify fixtures/main-2.3.8.app --expect stable
+```
